Note [shape=note, style=filled, fillcolor="#FFF8E8", color="#D7B56D", fontsize=10, label="External actors are repeated only for readability (same system).\lInclude / extend link only use cases of the same package; “Send email” appears in every package that uses it.\lPayment: startPayment checks the hold BEFORE charging; if it expired the payment is rejected and the card is not charged.\lIssue tickets (extend): payment is confirmed by Stripe webhook, not by the browser.\lRelease seats (extend): 10 minutes elapsed, but not while a started payment is in progress (5 min grace).\lReservation: at most 8 tickets per user per event (TicketLimitExceededException); seat taken = 409.\lCancel: allowed before COMPLETED even with sold tickets; delete: only with no tickets sold.\lA PENDING organizer may create a DRAFT; publishing needs an approved (ACTIVE) account. Code has approval only; rejection is a target.\lSprint 2 code: every event has a hall and seats, so seat selection is «include».\lQR validation is done by the organizer (TICKET_VALIDATE); no separate actor.\l", pos="1130,-2070!"];
}